<title>SLOVAKIA: SLOVAKIA POSTS 6.13 BILLION CROWN H1 STATE BUDGET DEFICI.</title>
<headline>SLOVAKIA POSTS 6.13 BILLION CROWN H1 STATE BUDGET DEFICI.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia posted a budget deficit of 6.13 billion crowns for the first half of this year, with income of 79.5 billion crowns and expenditure of 85.7 billion crowns, Finance Minister Sergej Kozlik said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
